  "description": "Boss Town Tycoon by Zaib: start with a lemonade stand, earn money and open bigger businesses - tea stall, bakery, pizza, hotel, movie studio, tech company, airline, space rockets, then a Moon Base, Mars Colony, Asteroid Mining, Space Hotel and Galaxy Network. Hire managers, earn while you are away, open a free gift every day, catch lucky surprises, finish town missions to go from Stall Kid to Galaxy Boss, decorate your town and pick investor perks!",
